If lightning hits you there is 1 in 3 chance to destroy all your wands 
in the inventory except wands of lightning and 1 in 3 chance to destroy 
all your rings in the inventory except rings of shock resistance. Shock 
resistance does not cover the wands nor the rings. This is different 
from disintegration resistance that covers your armor.

I don't know if MC affects the chance of lightning hitting you but I 
don't think it does.

I had the unfortunate chance to hit the 1 in 3 for rings two times out 
of two. I distinctly remember that on both occasion the culprit had only 
one chance to use the wand before I claimed it.

